<title>USA: Oilex opens additional Big Foot Field pay.</title>
<headline>Oilex opens additional Big Foot Field pay.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oilex Inc said it has opened an additional pay interval in 12 of its Big Foot Field wells, Frio County, Texas.</p>
<p>Using new oil retrieval technology, on test, the wells are producing at rates of 24 barrels per day from the top 10 feet of the Olmos &quot;B&quot; sand, which has not been previously tested.</p>
<p>The company noted it owns 51 wells in the Big Foot field and the zone opened is in all 51 wells.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
